* Source power laws, exponent directions and zero-factor convention
V1 x 0 DC -2 AC 0
V2 p 0 DC 3 AC 1
V3 z 0 DC 0 AC 1
B1 caret 0 V=V(x)^V(p)
B2 realpart 0 V=POW(V(x),V(p))
B3 absolute 0 V=V(x)**V(p)
B4 masked 0 V=SGN(V(z))*V(z)**(-.5)
B5 caretzero 0 V=V(z)^.5
B6 abszero 0 V=V(z)**.5
.func sourcepower(x,p) {x**p}
B7 macro 0 V=sourcepower(V(x),V(p))
.op
.ac lin 2 1k 2k
.end
